<translate>
==== PhysicsObject ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is true, then the player will throw the given item. The icon specified in this parameter will be used.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PhysicsObject	=	Molotov,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

